  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1256083456
    m_Localized: User Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637888
    m_Localized: User Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637889
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637890
    m_Localized: Mixed Reality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637891
    m_Localized: VR Tour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637892
    m_Localized: VR Museum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637893
    m_Localized: 01  /  Align and explore the site
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637894
    m_Localized: 02  /  Travel through the virtual tour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637895
    m_Localized: 03  /  Discover the museum collection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637896
    m_Localized: '<b>1  PLACE THE OUTLINE</b>

      Hold the RIGHT GRIP and move
      the controller to match the outline to the real entrance sign/table.


      <b>2 
      ADJUST THE ALIGNMENT</b>

      While holding grip, move the right stick left/right
      to rotate, or up/down to adjust reach. Match the edges and height.


      <b>3 
      CONFIRM</b>

      Release grip, then press A. Wait for the alignment to lock.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637897
    m_Localized: '<b>EXPLORE THE RESTORATION</b>

      After alignment, press A
      to show/hide the model. While it is visible, press B to show/hide site information.
      Use the page buttons to read more.


      <b>REALIGN</b>

      Hold X for
      two seconds to align again.


      <b>RETURN HOME</b>

      Tap X, then tap
      X again while confirmation is visible, or use Home on the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637898
    m_Localized: '<b>CHOOSE AN AREA</b>

      Select an area from the tour menu.


      <b>TRAVEL
      TO ANOTHER VIEWPOINT</b>

      Push the LEFT STICK forward. Aim the arc at
      an arrow; release when highlighted. Pull backward or release without a selected
      arrow to cancel.


      <b>PANORAMA ZOOM</b>

      Hold B to zoom in; hold
      A to zoom out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637899
    m_Localized: '<b>INSPECT A RECONSTRUCTION</b>

      Where available, press Y
      to enter/leave. X also exits. Navigation pauses.


      Grip with either controller
      to move/turn the model. Right stick left/right rotates it; click the stick
      to reset position, rotation and size. Hold B to enlarge; hold A to reduce.


      <b>RETURN
      TO MENU / HOME</b>

      Outside inspection, press X for the tour menu. There,
      tap X twice at confirmation for Home, or use the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637900
    m_Localized: '<b>EXPLORE THE GALLERY</b>

      Use the left stick to move and
      the right stick to turn. Look for an exhibit''s information icon.


      <b>INSPECT
      AN ARTIFACT</b>

      Point at the information icon and press the index trigger.


      <b>ROTATE
      AND RESET</b>

      During inspection, grip with either controller and turn
      your hand to rotate. On supported exhibits, right stick left/right also rotates;
      click it to reset position, rotation and size.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637901
    m_Localized: '<b>ZOOM AND COMPARE</b>

      Hold B to enlarge the artifact;
      hold A to reduce it. Press Y to switch models when an alternate version is
      available.


      <b>CONTINUE EXPLORING</b>

      Press X to leave inspection.
      Movement resumes after you exit.


      <b>RETURN HOME</b>

      Outside
      inspection, tap X and then tap again at the confirmation, or select Home on
      the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637902
    m_Localized: "<b>TABLET</b>  Left Menu: open/hide  \u2022  Home: main menu  \u2022 
      Change Language: English/Thai\n<b>AI CHAT BOT</b>  Type, then Send. Voice:
      Speak \u2192 talk \u2192 Speak again to stop \u2192 wait for text \u2192 Send.\n<b>CLEAR</b> 
      Removes displayed messages and cancels the current response.\n<b>SELECT</b> 
      Point at a button and press the index trigger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338373955584
    m_Localized: Point and select
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338579476480
    m_Localized: Point at a button, then press the index trigger to select it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670784
    m_Localized: Choose an experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670785
    m_Localized: Choose Mixed Reality, VR Tour, or VR Museum from the main menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670786
    m_Localized: Open or hide the tablet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670787
    m_Localized: Press the Menu button on the left controller to open or hide the
      tablet. Select Home on the tablet to return to the main menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670788
    m_Localized: Change language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670789
    m_Localized: Select Change Language on the tablet to switch between English and
      Thai.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670790
    m_Localized: Position the entrance outline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670791
    m_Localized: Hold the RIGHT GRIP and move the controller to match the outline
      to the real entrance sign or table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670792
    m_Localized: Fine-tune the alignment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670793
    m_Localized: Keep holding RIGHT GRIP. Move the right stick left/right to rotate,
      or up/down to adjust reach. Match the edges and height.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670794
    m_Localized: Release grip and confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670795
    m_Localized: Release RIGHT GRIP, then press A. Wait for the alignment to lock
      before exploring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670796
    m_Localized: Show or hide the restoration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670797
    m_Localized: After alignment, press A to show or hide the restoration model.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670798
    m_Localized: View site information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670799
    m_Localized: While the model is visible, press B to show or hide site information.
      Use the page buttons to read more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670800
    m_Localized: Realign the site
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670801
    m_Localized: 'Hold X for two seconds to align again.

      To return Home, tap
      X twice, confirming the prompt, or use Home on the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670802
    m_Localized: Select a location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670803
    m_Localized: Select an area from the tour menu to begin exploring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670804
    m_Localized: Aim at a navigation arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670805
    m_Localized: Push the LEFT STICK forward, then aim the arc at a navigation arrow
      until it highlights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670806
    m_Localized: Release to travel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338583670807
    m_Localized: Release the LEFT STICK while an arrow is highlighted to travel there.
      Pull backward, or release without a selected arrow, to cancel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865088
    m_Localized: Zoom the panorama
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865089
    m_Localized: Hold B to zoom in. Hold A to zoom out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865090
    m_Localized: Inspect a reconstruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865091
    m_Localized: Where inspection is available, press Y to enter or leave it. X also
      exits inspection. Navigation pauses while inspecting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865092
    m_Localized: Move or turn the reconstruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865093
    m_Localized: During inspection, hold GRIP on either controller and move or turn
      your hand to adjust the model.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865094
    m_Localized: Rotate with the thumbstick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865095
    m_Localized: During inspection, move the RIGHT STICK left or right to rotate
      the model.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865096
    m_Localized: Reset the inspection model
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865097
    m_Localized: Click the RIGHT STICK to reset the model's position, rotation, and
      size.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865098
    m_Localized: Enlarge or reduce the reconstruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865099
    m_Localized: 'Hold B to enlarge; hold A to reduce.

      Outside inspection,
      press X for the tour menu. Use Home on the tablet to return to the main menu.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865100
    m_Localized: Move around the gallery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865101
    m_Localized: Use the LEFT STICK to move and the RIGHT STICK to turn. Look for
      an exhibit's information icon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865102
    m_Localized: Select an exhibit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865103
    m_Localized: Point at an exhibit's information icon and press the index trigger
      to inspect it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865104
    m_Localized: Grip and rotate the artifact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865105
    m_Localized: During inspection, hold GRIP on either controller and turn your
      hand to rotate the artifact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865106
    m_Localized: Rotate and reset supported exhibits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865107
    m_Localized: On supported exhibits, move the RIGHT STICK left/right to rotate.
      Click it to reset position, rotation, and size.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865108
    m_Localized: Enlarge or reduce the artifact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865109
    m_Localized: During inspection, hold B to enlarge the artifact or hold A to reduce
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865110
    m_Localized: Compare alternate models
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865111
    m_Localized: Press Y to switch models when an alternate version is available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865112
    m_Localized: Leave artifact inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865113
    m_Localized: 'Press X to leave inspection and resume moving.

      Outside inspection,
      tap X and confirm with X again to return Home, or use Home on the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865114
    m_Localized: Type and send a question
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865115
    m_Localized: 'Type your question in the AI chat, then select Send.

      Clear
      removes displayed messages and cancels the current response.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865116
    m_Localized: Ask a question by voice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865117
    m_Localized: Select Speak, ask your question, then select Speak again to stop.
      Wait for the text to appear, then select Send.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865118
    m_Localized: Getting Started
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1862338587865119
    m_Localized: AI Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
